WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.420
Ok so season 4 of Cobra Kai delivered on so
many levels and I loved seeing another All

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.870
Valley Championships as well as the paths
we followed to get there.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:13.860
Whether it was Miguel's big spinal injury
recovery, Hawks return after having been cut

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:19.230
down a peg or two, Tory and her troubled personal
life or the introduction of Kenny the season

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.699
was one of the strongest we've had so far.

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:23.640
But what happens from here on out?

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.050
Well that's what we're gonna be discussing
in this video as we go through the biggest

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.839
theories for the future of the show.

00:00:28.839 --> 00:00:33.020
If this is your first time here then welcome
to the Heavy Spoilers show, I'm your host

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:38.550
Paul aka the guy who never backs out like
Miguel, now let's get into the breakdown.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:43.830
Ok, so the season ended with Silver framing
Kreese for the violent assault on Stinkray.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:49.760
We learned that Silver made ol' Stinky tell
the police that it was in fact Kreese that

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.450
smashed his face in like you should smash
that like button in order to let him rejoin

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:53.450
Cobra Kai.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.130
The police turned up to take Kreese away and
he didn't exactly do himself any favours by

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.870
hitting one of the officers.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.720
Towards the end of the series, we saw Kreese
seemed to change his ways and he actually

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:07.430
started developing some feelings and emotions
towards others.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.241
Kreese was becoming a changed man and not
only had he started dropping the 'show no

00:01:11.241 --> 00:01:15.520
mercy' side of the slogan but he probably
also wouldnt be feeding any pet mice named

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.930
fluffles to cobras in future.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.909
This seemed to really aggravate Silver and
his big plan was already in motion which we

00:01:22.909 --> 00:01:26.139
discovered was to develop and expand Cobra
Kai.

00:01:26.139 --> 00:01:30.259
If you cast your mind back to the ending of
Karate Kid 3 then you may remember that he

00:01:30.259 --> 00:01:34.799
wanted to do this throughout the valley but
the defeat by Daniel and probably poor critical

00:01:34.799 --> 00:01:38.030
scores at the time stopped it dead in it's
tracks.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.799
I can imagine moving forward we will see his
plans being put into effect with Silver beginning

00:01:42.799 --> 00:01:48.189
to open new branches, and being the big bad
guy once more, however, I can't see it lasting

00:01:48.189 --> 00:01:52.579
too long once the truth is out about Kreese
and his wrongful imprisonment.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:56.829
Beyond that it would be great to see Silvers
original protege Mike Barnes turn up at some

00:01:56.829 --> 00:01:58.960
point to get Silver out of trouble.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:02.540
Silver did say that he was reaching out to
others and if he's gonna be opening up several

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:06.799
new franchises then he'll need Karate experts
he trusts to help set them up.

00:02:06.799 --> 00:02:11.230
Barnes was one of the biggest bad guys in
the original trilogy and seeing them team

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.510
up again would be a great.&nbsp;

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:17.600
The way these relationships change quicker
than a season of Love Island, you never know

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:22.650
whos gonna team up next, but I think we will
be due another big threat in the future.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:26.880
At some point I think we will go on to see
Stingray reveal the truth about what happened

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:32.130
and this will, in turn, lead to Kreese being
released and Silver being banged up instead,

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.780
halting his development of the Cobra Kai brand.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:41.920
I think we could see a big change in Kreeses's
mindset as he clearly started to have some

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:46.570
regrets over his treatment of Johnny over
the years, revealing that he saw him as a

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.680
son more than anything else.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.840
This could possibly lead to the making of
the peace between the pair and a potential

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.620
union on the cards.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:56.090
As we know that the structure of the show
kind of repeats these cycles of making up

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:59.840
and breaking up quite regularly.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:10.251
I'd love to see the three sides in Season
5 be made up of Silver and Barnes, Kreese

00:03:10.251 --> 00:03:13.290
and Johnny and of course Daniel and Chozen.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:17.540
We could also see Stingray return once this
has all taken place and rejoin the Cobra Kai

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.170
ranks once more under the new Kreese and Johnny
after the pair regain control.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:26.480
I'm not sure what the future holds for Eagle
Fang as they also lost the competition alongside

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:30.660
Miyagi Do, which meant they both had to cease
from operating as Dojos.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:35.290
Whether this deal will hold up or not is another
thing especially with the match-fixing and

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.040
surrounding scandal.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:41.740
With Chozen being brought in it is also possible
that Daniel may find a loophole and that they'll

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:46.370
be able to have him as the dojo head as he
was never part of any of the others.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.620
Another factor we need to throw into the mix
is the fact that Tory overheard Silver bribing

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.260
the All Valley referee.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:56.760
I think this could all come out and just pile
on top of Silver and his impending prosecution

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.510
for the assault of Stingray.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:02.990
We also know that Tory had been teasing with
the idea of trying to make up with Sam, but

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:08.620
Sam wasn't having any of it and always reacted
by insulting and shutting her down constantly.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.670
Maybe this could be the thing to unite them,
once she comes clean about the fight fixing

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:17.650
scandal, we could potentially see Tory ditching
Cobra Kai and joining Daniel and Sam.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:22.900
This is all just theories right now though
but I think this could be a nice way for the

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.090
story to develop.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:28.840
I also think Tory will tell Robbie, and he
will be stuck having to choose what to do.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:32.710
We saw Robbie and Johnny making up at the
end of the series and it would be great to

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:36.350
see father and son back together, fighting
alongside each other.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:41.020
The series closed out with Daniel visiting
Mr Miyagi's grave, explaining how he tried

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:44.150
his best to follow the right path but it wasn't
enough.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:48.770
He talks about needing to change and go on
the offence to take down Cobra Kai.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:54.810
As he asks for help the camera spins to reveal
Chozen standing by his side at Miyagi's grave.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:59.580
The pair agree to work together to take down
Cobra Kai once and for all.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:04.221
We were first re-introduced to Chozen back
in Season 3, as we learned that Daniel believed

00:05:04.221 --> 00:05:05.221
he knew everything there was to know that
Miyagi had taught him, until Chozen showed

00:05:05.221 --> 00:05:06.221
him there were still some secrets.

00:05:06.221 --> 00:05:08.379
This is where we learned Miyagi passed on
a scroll to Chozen containing this new technique,

00:05:08.379 --> 00:05:12.560
Chozen then demonstrated this technique on
Daniel and paralysed his arm.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:16.980
In Season 4 we see as LaPusso himself discovers
this scroll in Daniels Dojo, which could be

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.680
some serious foreshadowing on the horizon.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:23.440
Daniel also used some of the techniques against
Johnny and I think they're being dotted throughout

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.510
the seasons to potentially build towards their
usage in the future.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:31.480
Going forward I believe we will see Chozen
and Daniel uniting and changing the ways of

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:37.610
the Miyagi Do to incorporate a new more balanced
style, now covering offence as well as defence.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:41.200
We can see that this is something that Daniel
has struggled to come to terms with throughout

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:46.900
the series as he has been so stuck in his
ways, but in a flashback we saw as Miyagi

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.980
told him in time he would adapt and create
his own style.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:54.870
So, I think we will see the two sides, the
offensive style being brought in by Chozen

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:58.370
whilst Daniel adapts his more defensive approach
to enhance his game.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:02.550
Now, who they go on to face is all a bit up
in the air at the moment, but Im guessing

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:06.140
it will still be a Silver led Cobra Kai until
he is brought to justice.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:11.050
Now towards the end of the final episode we
also discover that Miguel has gone AWOL like

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:14.220
Johnnys dad did when he popped out to get
a pack of smokes.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:18.900
He is actually heading off to Mexico City
on the last bus outta town and where we go

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.480
from here we don't know.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:25.590
Now In my ending explained I did say that
this may have been done to free up Xolo Maridueña's

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.340
schedule so that he could go off to film Blue
Beetle.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:33.210
However as many of you pointed out, Season
5 has actually already been filmed and therefore

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.419
his appearance won't be affected my scheduling.

00:06:36.419 --> 00:06:42.330
However, I don't accept that I ever get things
wrong and I don't have any weaknesses so say

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.770
goodbye to your favourite mouse.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:49.199
Now we learn from Carmen that Miguels father
is a pretty bad guy who doesn't actually know

00:06:49.199 --> 00:06:50.570
he has a son.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:54.260
So this doesn't really bode well for Miguel
going in search of the father he has never

00:06:54.260 --> 00:07:08.280
met, nor does his 
father know Miguel exists.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:13.699
I think this is only gonna end badly with
Miguel returning rejected by his father, back

00:07:13.699 --> 00:07:17.320
to the arms of his makeshift one aka&nbsp; Johnny
Lawrence.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:20.760
However I don't think that we will be back
to square one and he will likely be annoyed

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.540
that Carmen didn't tell his father about him.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.500
In this season, though she and Johnny Told
Miguel about their relationship they did keep

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:32.530
it from him for some time and coupled in with
the dad thing it could be the straw that broke

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:33.720
the camels back.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.440
It would be nice to see Johnny and Miguel
make up and I think Johnny is due a bit of

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:42.330
good fortune as he has definitely changed
his ways a lot since the series began.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:46.210
As for who Miguels father is I don't think
there's really been any evidence to support

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:49.730
him being Silver like I know a lot of you
in the comments are saying.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:54.520
Though that would be a Dart Vader Level twist
that would be worthy of the Maury show I don't

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.790
think it's likely.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:08:00.300
Carmen ended up attending the All Valley and
in doing this she would've at least seen Silver

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:03.080
and therefore would likely recognise him.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:08.050
Also though we aren't 100% what happened with
Silver after Karate Kid 3, I doubt he went

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.470
to Mexico City.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:14.639
Judging by his Mansion he likely just stayed
in the US and continued to build his Empire.

00:08:14.639 --> 00:08:18.419
Now people are also saying that Mike Barnes
might be Miguel's father too.

00:08:18.419 --> 00:08:22.700
I'm still kinda in the camp that he has some
relation to Tory and when you think about

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.070
it we still know very little about her.

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:28.810
She just showed up one day being a highly
advanced fighter and I think it would be a

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:33.099
pretty big reveal if it turned out that Barnes
was her day.

00:08:33.099 --> 00:08:43.470
Now, a part of the season which I loved was
the scenes between Kenny and Anthony.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:47.930
Backed up by his group of nerdy mates, Anthony
picks on Kenny from day one after seeing him

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.190
dancing at the bus stop.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:53.431
The two both have an interest in the same
girl and LaPusso, simply cant handle it, as

00:08:53.431 --> 00:08:57.510
deep down he's still that spoilt little brat
we saw in earlier seasons.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:01.520
Anthony continues to push Kenny to breaking
point until he decides he needs to stand up

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:04.950
for himself and we watch as Kenny joins Cobra
Kai.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:08.990
In doing so he changes drastically into a
cold blooded, killing machine that is the

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.150
master of stealth takedowns.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.860
In the final scene between the pair we see
Anthony try to speak to Kenny in the locker

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.670
room and from this we witness how much the
latter has changed.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:22.860
He's gone from being the shy nervous kid he
once was to somebody with Cobra Kai venom

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.860
surging through their veins.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:29.270
I loved seeing him slamming LaPusso into the
lockers and piling into him but it just goes

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.230
to cement the effect the Sensei's have had
on their students.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:36.680
I think this rivalry will continue on in to
the next season and we will potentially see

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.070
a face off between Anthony and Kenny, however.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:43.290
We're back in the same cycle where one person
bullies one character, that character becomes

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:48.530
a ninja and retaliates and then that other
person has to join a dojo so that they can

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.530
at least keep up.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:50.530
Unlike the constant switching sides though
I just can't see Anthony rebelling against

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.530
his father and joining another dojo.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:54.470
Sam has stuck it out with her dad and add
to this we saw Anthony discover the scrolls

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:57.760
for the paralysing pressure punch moves which
we mentioned earlier.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:02.250
Who knows, Anthony might even study these
and it could come into play against Kenny

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.250
next time.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:07.440
Either way I'm betting they go head to head
at the next all valley but which dojo goes

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.510
against Cobra Kai is gonna be interesting
to see.

